### Login (para obter o token)
POST {{api_url}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "joao.silva@example.com",
  "password": "Senha@123"
}

### Get all users
GET {{api_url}}/api/user?pageNumber=2&pageSize=2
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get user by UID (substitua pelo UID real)
GET {{api_url}}/api/user/4816b133-d277-4a81-90a4-09b4c5a8dc87
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create new user
POST {{api_url}}/api/user
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Tatiane",
  "email": "tatiane@example.com",
  "password": "Senha@123",
  "role": 1
}

### Update user (substitua pelo UID real)
PUT {{api_url}}/api/user/4816b133-d277-4a81-90a4-09b4c5a8dc87
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "João Silva Atualizado",
  "email": "joao.silva@example.com",
  "role": 1
}

### Delete user (substitua pelo UID real)
DELETE {{api_url}}/api/user/4816b133-d277-4a81-90a4-09b4c5a8dc87
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

